# Review ownership for the files that decide what CI verifies (ADR 0016).
#
# On a `pull_request` event GitHub runs the workflow from the pull request's head tree, so a change
# to the workflow can change what "green" means for that very pull request. The same is true of
# tools/ci/, which computes the classifier verdict. These are the only paths where a passing run is
# no evidence about the change itself, so they are the paths that need a person to look.
#
# CODEOWNERS requests this review. Making it a merge requirement needs "Require review from Code
# Owners" in the default-branch ruleset, which is a repository setting rather than a file.

/.github/workflows/ @aljopro
/.github/CODEOWNERS @aljopro
/tools/ci/ @aljopro
